@startuml item_state
title Item - State Diagram

state "In world" as InWorld
state "Held in hotbar" as Held
state "Active" as Active
state "Not in world" as Consumed

[*] --> InWorld : item placed on map

InWorld --> Held : player picks it up [inventory has space]
Held --> InWorld : player drops item

Held --> Held : player uses item [Non-consumable] kept in inventory
Held --> Consumed : player uses it [Consumable] / apply effect
Held --> Active : player uses timed item, start effect/countdown.
Active --> Consumed : Time reaches 0.
Consumed --> [*] : item depleated / free slot, remove from render

@enduml
